  era: "1851\u20131876 \xB7 Section 24 \xB7 Rise of Nationalism \xB7 1850s \u2013 1910s"
  title: Early nationalism
  text: Western education, newspapers, railways and shared grievances fostered a national consciousness. Associations such as the British Indian Association, the Poona Sarvajanik Sabha and the Indian Association of 1876 prepared the ground.
